{"id":"c0fe5ecedfe72c4b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-mackey-arens.md","title":"Mackey–Arens Theorem","display":"thm-mackey-arens — Mackey–Arens Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mackey-arens","aliases":["58-thm-mackey-arens"],"display":"thm-mackey-arens — Mackey–Arens Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-dual-pairing]]","[[58-df-mackey-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mackey-arens"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mackey-arens</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mackey-arens — Mackey–Arens Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a91ae6809cec03c\" href=\"?note=2a91ae6809cec03c\" title=\"58-df-dual-pairing\">58-df-dual-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1484ba48c364679\" href=\"?note=b1484ba48c364679\" title=\"58-df-mackey-topology\">58-df-mackey-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> are complex vector spaces with designated operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\">\\(+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_Y,\\cdot_Y\">\\(+_Y,\\cdot_Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span> is a dual pairing.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> are topology candidates on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a91ae6809cec03c\" href=\"?note=2a91ae6809cec03c\" title=\"58-df-dual-pairing\">58-df-dual-pairing</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b1484ba48c364679\" href=\"?note=b1484ba48c364679\" title=\"58-df-mackey-topology\">58-df-mackey-topology</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}sandwich}\\vdash\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\to \\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}sandwich}\\vdash\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\to \\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}maximality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\to\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}maximality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\to\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The weak and Mackey topologies are respectively the coarsest and finest compatible locally convex topologies for the represented dual pair.</li>\n<li>The maximality assertion quantifies over set-coded topologies and avoids the undefined class operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finest}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finest}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Mackey topology is generated by uniform-convergence seminorms on absolutely convex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(Y,X)\">\\(\\sigma(Y,X)\\)</span>-compact subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dual-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"2a91ae6809cec03c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dual-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mackey-topology","status":"resolved","id":"b1484ba48c364679","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mackey-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dual-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"2a91ae6809cec03c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}$ is the predicate from [[58-df-dual-pairing]].","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mackey-topology","status":"resolved","id":"b1484ba48c364679","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S$, $\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S$, and $\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-mackey-topology]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X","display":false},{"tex":"+_Y,\\cdot_Y","display":false},{"tex":"B:X\\times Y\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}sandwich}\\vdash\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDualTopology}_S(\\sigma,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\to \\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DualPairing}_{\\mathbb C}(X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mackey\\text{-}arens\\text{-}maximality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MackeyTopology}_S(\\mu,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\n\\to\\forall\\mathcal T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompatibleLCTopology}_S(\\mathcal T,X,Y,B,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y)\\to\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mu\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(Y,X)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":2189,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-mackey-arens.md|58-thm-mackey-arens]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["2a91ae6809cec03c","b1484ba48c364679"]}